ng and fulfilling (event_time: 2022-11-04T15:56:00Z)\n  - Joanna has writing as a long-term passion. (event_time: 2022-11-07T20:10:00Z)\n  - Joanna recalls the difficult process of finishing her screenplay. (event_time: 2022-05-25T15:00:00Z)\n  - Joanna shared her book with her writers group the previous week (event_time: 2022-08-15T00:00:00Z)\n  - Joanna explored the theme of love in her writing. (event_time: None)\n  - Joanna uses writing as a way to express her feelings (event_time: 2022-08-14T18:12:00Z)\n  - Writing gives Joanna a chance to put down all her feelings (event_time: 2022-08-14T18:12:00Z)\n  - Writing gives Joanna a chance to put down all her thoughts (event_time: 2022-08-14T18:12:00Z)\n  - Joanna's movie was successful, which led her to start writing a book. (event_time: 2022-07-10T14:34:00Z)\n  - Joanna has never tried publishing a book before, but is considering making a book her first publication. (event_time: 2022-07-10T14:34:00Z)\n  - Joanna worked hard on a script (event_time: 2022-11-09T17:54:00Z)\n  - Joanna just finished submitting her recent screenplay to a film contest (event_time: 2022-06-24T10:55:00Z)\n  - Joanna explored the theme of sisterhood in her writing. (event_time: None)\n  - The project Joanna finished is the screenplay (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna is currently writing a movie script. (event_time: 2022-11-07T20:10:00Z)\n  - Joanna intends to continue pursuing her passion for writing. (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna uses Writing and creative projects to get through tough times. (event_time: 2022-05-20T19:49:00Z)\n  - Joanna has been working on a screenplay. (event_time: 2022-05-02T11:54:00Z)\n  - Writing might be a way for Joanna to express creativity. (event_time: 2022-08-14T18:12:00Z)\n  - Joanna is the author of a published movie. (event_time: 2022-07-10T14:34:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - book: Joanna finished writing