t week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Gina stays motivated by reminding herself of her successes and progress. (event_time: 2023-04-25T11:24:00Z)\n  - Gina possesses awesome determination. (event_time: 2023-03-16T14:35:00Z)\n  - Jon is asking Gina for tips on how to stay confident in his business. (event_time: 2023-04-25T11:24:00Z)\n  - Jon thinks Gina's commitment and creativity in her own business stands out. (event_time: 2023-02-08T09:32:00Z)\n  - Gina advises staying resilient. (event_time: 2023-06-16T21:38:00Z)\n  - Gina thinks of the big goals to stay motivated. (event_time: 2023-04-25T11:24:00Z)\n  - Gina believes confidence is important for Jon in business. (event_time: 2023-04-25T11:24:00Z)\n  - Gina dances it out to stay motivated/cope. (event_time: 2023-04-25T11:24:00Z)\n  - Gina indicated that networking events were a lifesaver for her business. (event_time: 2023-07-21T17:44:00Z)\n  - Gina does not shy away from a challenge (event_time: 2023-02-08T09:32:00Z)\n  - Gina is focused on building her customer base for her online store. (event_time: 2023-04-03T13:26:00Z)\n  - Gina expresses belief that she and Jon can succeed. (event_time: 2023-04-25T11:24:00Z)\n  - Gina considers her spot to be comfortable and inviting for her customers (event_time: 2023-02-01T00:48:00Z)\n  - Gina tells Jon that starting a business takes courage and encourages him. (event_time: 2023-03-23T19:28:00Z)\n  - Gina is asking for advice or tips on running a successful biz. (event_time: 2023-03-23T19:28:00Z)\n  - Gina is willing to take risks (event_time: 2023-02-08T09:32:00Z)\n  - Gina is asking Jon what helps him stay motivated with his dance studio business. (event_time: 2023-03-23T19:28:00Z)\n  - Gina is continuously working on building relationships. (event_time: 2023-03-23T19:28:00Z)\n  - Gina describes the experience of